--------------------
OUTER JOIN/LEFT OUTER JOIN: Returns all rows from the left table, and the matching rows from the right table; if no match exists, right‑table columns are NULL
RIGHT OUTER JOIN Returns all rows from the right table, and the matching rows from the left table; if no match exists, left‑table columns are NULL
FULL OUTER JOIN: get all records from both table and wheater its matching(satisfy the JOIN condition) or not 
